 4. power_loadflow OPTIONS, FROM ITS OWN HELP
=================================================================
     POWER_LOADFLOW Computes the load flow of a Simscape Electrical Specialized Power Systems model.
    
       LF = POWER_LOADFLOW(SYS,'solve') computes the load flow of SYS using the default load flow parameters. 
       The model is initialized with the load flow solution. 
    
       LF = POWER_LOADFLOW(SYS,'parameters') returns the load flow parameters
       of SYS. LF can be edited to customize new load flow solution.
    
       LF = POWER_LOADFLOW(SYS,'solve',LF)computes the load flow of SYS with the load
       flow parameters defined in LF structure. LF is augmented with the load flow results.
       The model is initialized with the load flow solution.
    
       POWER_LOADFLOW(SYS,'solve','report',FNAME) computes the load flow 
       then save detailed information in FNAME MATLAB file.
    
       POWER_LOADFLOW(SYS,'solve','ExcelReport',FNAME) computes the load flow 
       then save detailed information in FNAME Excel file.
       Documentation for power_loadflow
          doc power_loadflow
   

